---
// Privacy Policy — content ported from the prior React build at
// _deploy_old/privacy/. Styled to match /about and /methodology:
// max-width 768px, DM Serif Display H1 + H2, slate-500 body, amber eyebrow.
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy | RankMyAnnuity";
const description =
  "How RankMyAnnuity.pro collects, uses, and protects your personal data, including cookies, analytics, and advertising.";

const SERIF = "'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif";

const h2Style = `font-family:${SERIF};font-size:24px;color:rgb(1,8,22);margin:32px 0 12px 0;font-weight:400;`;
const h3Style = `font-family:${SERIF};font-size:18px;color:rgb(1,8,22);margin:20px 0 8px 0;font-weight:400;`;
const pStyle = "color:rgb(100,116,139);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 16px 0;";
const dlStyle = "margin:0 0 16px 0;";
const dtStyle = "font-weight:600;color:rgb(1,8,22);font-size:15px;margin-top:12px;";
const ddStyle = "color:rgb(100,116,139);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:0;";
const linkStyle = "color:rgb(1,8,22);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <main
    style="max-width:768px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px;color:rgb(1,8,22);font-family:'DM Sans',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;"
  >
    <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:rgb(245,158,11);margin:0 0 12px 0;">Legal</p>

    <h1 style={`font-family:${SERIF};font-size:clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);color:rgb(1,8,22);margin:0 0 12px 0;line-height:1.15;font-weight:400;`}>
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <p style="color:rgb(100,116,139);font-size:18px;line-height:1.625;margin:0 0 40px 0;">
      Last updated: May 12, 2026
    </p>

    <p style={pStyle}>
      This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use and disclosure of Your information when You use the Service and tells You about Your privacy rights and how the law protects You. We use Your Personal Data to provide and improve the Service. By using the Service, You agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>Interpretation and Definitions</h2>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      The words whose initial letters are capitalized have meanings defined under the following conditions. The following definitions shall have the same meaning regardless of whether they appear in singular or in plural.
    </p>

    <dl style={dlStyle}>
      <dt style={dtStyle}>Account</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>A unique account created for You to access our Service or parts of our Service.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Affiliate</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>An entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with a party, where "control" means ownership of 50% or more of the shares, equity interest or other securities entitled to vote for election of directors or other managing authority.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Company</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Referred to as either "the Company", "We", "Us" or "Our" — refers to Rank My Annuity.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Cookies</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Small files placed on Your device by a website, containing details of Your browsing history among other uses.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Country</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Washington, United States.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Device</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Any device that can access the Service such as a computer, a cell phone or a digital tablet.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Personal Data</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Service</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>The Website.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Service Provider</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Any natural or legal person who processes data on behalf of the Company.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Usage Data</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Data collected automatically from the use of the Service.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Website</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Rank My Annuity, accessible from <a href="https://rankmyannuity.pro" style={linkStyle}>rankmyannuity.pro</a>.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>You</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>The individual accessing or using the Service.</dd>
    </dl>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>Collecting and Using Your Personal Data</h2>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Types of Data Collected</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      Usage Data is collected automatically when using the Service and may include information such as Your device's IP address, browser type, browser version, pages visited, time and date of visit, time spent on pages, and unique device identifiers.
    </p>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Tracking Technologies and Cookies</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      We use Cookies and similar tracking technologies to track activity on Our Service. Where required by law, we use non-essential cookies only with Your consent. You can withdraw consent at any time via Your browser settings.
    </p>

    <dl style={dlStyle}>
      <dt style={dtStyle}>Necessary / Essential Cookies</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Session cookies required to provide core website functionality.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Cookie Acceptance Cookies</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Persistent cookies that record whether you have accepted cookie use.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Functionality Cookies</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Persistent cookies that remember your preferences.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Tracking and Performance Cookies</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Third-party cookies used to track traffic and analyze site usage.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Targeting and Advertising Cookies</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Third-party cookies used to serve interest-based advertising.</dd>
    </dl>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Use of Your Personal Data</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      The Company may use Personal Data to provide and maintain the Service, analyze usage trends, improve the Service, and support advertising that helps sustain the Service. We may share Your Personal Data with Service Providers, in connection with business transfers, or with Your consent.
    </p>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Retention and Deletion</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      We retain Personal Data only as long as necessary. Analytics and usage data is retained for up to 24 months. You have the right to request deletion of Your Personal Data by contacting Us.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>Analytics &amp; Advertising</h2>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Google Analytics</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      We use Google Analytics 4 to monitor and analyze how visitors use this Site. Google Analytics collects data such as pages visited, time on site, referral source, and general geographic region. This data is aggregated and does not identify you personally. You may opt out via the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" style={linkStyle} rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style={linkStyle} rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Google AdSense &amp; Advertising Cookies</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      We use Google AdSense to display advertisements on this Site. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies — including the DoubleClick DART cookie — to serve ads to visitors of this Site based on their prior visits to this and other websites across the internet. Google also uses data collected from this Site to serve ads on other websites. The use of advertising cookies enables Google and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to this Site and/or other websites on the internet.
    </p>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" style={linkStyle} rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>. You may also opt out of the use of cookies by third-party vendors for personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="http://www.networkadvertising.org/managing/opt_out.aspx" style={linkStyle} rel="noopener">Network Advertising Initiative opt-out page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>Disclosure of Your Personal Data</h2>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      Under certain circumstances the Company may be required to disclose Your Personal Data if required by law, to protect the rights or property of the Company, or to prevent wrongdoing in connection with the Service.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>California Privacy Rights (CCPA / CPRA)</h2>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      If you are a California resident, the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) and California Privacy Rights Act (CPRA) provide you with specific rights regarding your personal information.
    </p>
    <dl style={dlStyle}>
      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Know</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to request that we disclose what personal information we collect, use, disclose, and sell about you.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Delete</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to request that we delete personal information we have collected from you, subject to certain exceptions.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Opt Out of Sale / Sharing</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>We do not sell your personal information for monetary consideration. However, sharing data with advertising partners (such as Google AdSense) may constitute "sharing" under CPRA. You may opt out of such sharing by using the opt-out links in the Advertising section above, or by contacting us directly.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Non-Discrimination</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>We will not discriminate against you for exercising any of your CCPA rights.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Correct</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to request correction of inaccurate personal information we maintain about you.</dd>
    </dl>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:rankmyannuity@gmail.com" style={linkStyle}>rankmyannuity@gmail.com</a>. We will respond to verified requests within 45 days as required by law.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>EEA, UK &amp; Switzerland — GDPR Rights</h2>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), the United Kingdom, or Switzerland, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and applicable local data protection laws grant you the following rights with respect to your personal data.
    </p>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Data Controller</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      The data controller for this Site is the operator of RankMyAnnuity.pro. You can reach us at <a href="mailto:rankmyannuity@gmail.com" style={linkStyle}>rankmyannuity@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Lawful Basis for Processing</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>We process personal data on the following legal bases:</p>
    <dl style={dlStyle}>
      <dt style={dtStyle}>Legitimate Interests</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Site analytics (Google Analytics) are processed on the basis of our legitimate interest in understanding how the Site is used and improving its content, provided this interest is not overridden by your rights.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Consent</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Advertising and targeting cookies (Google AdSense / DoubleClick) are placed only with your explicit consent, which you may provide or withdraw at any time via the cookie consent banner displayed on your first visit to the Site.</dd>
    </dl>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Your Rights Under GDPR</h3>
    <dl style={dlStyle}>
      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right of Access</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Rectification</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to request correction of inaccurate or incomplete personal data.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Erasure ("Right to be Forgotten")</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to request deletion of your personal data where there is no compelling reason for us to continue processing it.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Restriction of Processing</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to request that we restrict processing of your personal data in certain circumstances.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Data Portability</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to receive your personal data in a structured, machine-readable format and to transmit it to another controller.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Object</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>You have the right to object to processing of your personal data where we rely on legitimate interests as the legal basis.</dd>

      <dt style={dtStyle}>Right to Withdraw Consent</dt>
      <dd style={ddStyle}>Where we process data on the basis of consent, you may withdraw that consent at any time without affecting the lawfulness of processing prior to withdrawal.</dd>
    </dl>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>International Data Transfers</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      This Site is operated from the United States. If you are located in the EEA, UK, or Switzerland, your data may be transferred to and processed in the United States. Google LLC is certified under the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework, providing an adequate level of data protection for transfers to the United States. For more information, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" style={linkStyle} rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h3 style={h3Style}>Supervisory Authority</h3>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      You have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection supervisory authority. For a list of EEA supervisory authorities, visit the <a href="https://edpb.europa.eu/about-edpb/about-edpb/members_en" style={linkStyle} rel="noopener">European Data Protection Board</a>.
    </p>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      To exercise any GDPR rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:rankmyannuity@gmail.com" style={linkStyle}>rankmyannuity@gmail.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      Our Service does not address anyone under the age of 16. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from anyone under the age of 16.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      We may update Our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify You of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2 style={h2Style}>Contact Us</h2>
    <p style={pStyle}>
      For questions about this Privacy Policy, to exercise your privacy rights (CCPA / GDPR), or to report a privacy concern, contact us at <a href="mailto:rankmyannuity@gmail.com" style={linkStyle}>rankmyannuity@gmail.com</a>, or via the <a href="/contact" style={linkStyle}>contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
